<category>
<pattern>ELIGIBILITY BACHELORS</pattern>
<template>
  First Year Degree Bachelor of Engineering

1. Passed HSC or its equivalent examination with Physics and Mathematics as compulsory subjects
OR
Passed Diploma in Engineering and Technology

Direct Second  Year Bachelor of Engineering 

1. Passed Diploma Course in Engineering and Technology
OR
Passed B.Sc Degree from a University Grants Commission (UGC) or Association of Indian Universities recognized University.
Link:https://www.sknscoe.ac.in/
